 "notes": "Public vs private subnets are not distinguishable in the plan (no attribute differs), so subnet checks count all six. map_public_ip_on_launch is required false for all subnets; the private subnets default to false as well. default_tags also requires the Project tag on every subnet's tags_all, as provider-level default tags would give (a VPC-only tag fails). Associations cannot be bound to the public/private route table (selectors cannot filter by refs)."
